  "executive_summary": "Eight isolated novel-domain gameplay turns scored 4 PASS and 4 FAIL. When the decision was attached, it authorized the authored facts, and bounded incidental play plus authorized movement succeeded. The kiln, dye vat, and chapel bell generations were competent and were then replaced by the canned sentence \"No one here can answer that from what is settled here\" after semantic_identity_mismatch. Social and movement turns never received a GMResolutionDecision, because attachment returns once a contract already exists. On that path, Nessa stated an unauthored organization as known fact. Decision B: localized defects. Return to targeted implementation. No production edits, no reruns, no 4x10 gate, no human playtest, and no PR-BS.",
